      "source": "The vector `{0.0, 1.0, 1.0, 0.0}` allows newly spawned particles to vary in saturation and brightness, resulting in random shades of red. Particles retain the same hue and alpha as the base color.",
      "normalizedSource": "The vector `{0.0, 1.0, 1.0, 0.0}` allows newly spawned particles to vary in saturation and brightness, resulting in random shades of red. Particles retain the same hue and alpha as the base color.",
